  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "NAME: NICK ASHMAN\r\nSTATUS: ACTIVE\r\nDATE OF BIRTH: 05.08.1964\r\nPOSITION:
    Cleaner / Containment Specialist\r\nCLEARANCE LEVEL: ALPHA\r\n\n\r\nPERFORMANCE
    OVERVIEW:\r\nNick demonstrates exceptional efficiency in all assigned duties
    \u2014 both in retrieval of escaped experiments and emergency containment. His
    combat proficiency with melee and ranged weaponry is rated above standard. Composure
    under pressure remains one of his strongest assets.\r\n\n\r\nPSYCHOLOGICAL NOTE:\r\nThe
    sole identified vulnerability: cognitive dissonance in everyday situations.\r\nNick
    operates best in binary systems \u2014 threat or safe, enemy or ally, logical
    or illogical. But when faced with human contradictions \u2014 when someone says
    \"I can't eat this\" but clearly wants to eat it \u2014 his processing fails.\r\nHis
    hybrid mind cannot reconcile logic (you said you can't) with desire (but you
    want to). He doesn't understand why someone wouldn't just act on what they want.
    This short-circuits his decision-making and triggers a loss of control.\r\n\n\r\nHISTORICAL
    CONTEXT:\r\nNick is designated as Experiment #1 \u2014 the first successful human-hybrid
    integration. Despite this, he continues active service. To date, he remains the
    most stable and effective hybrid specimen ever produced."
